st - simple terminal
--------------------
st is a simple terminal emulator for X which sucks less.


Requirements
------------
In order to build st you need the Xlib header files.


Installation
------------
Edit config.mk to match your local setup (st is installed into
the /usr/local namespace by default).

Afterwards enter the following command to build and install st (if
necessary as root):

    make clean install


Running st
----------
If you did not install st with make clean install, you must compile
the st terminfo entry with the following command:

    tic -sx st.info

See the man page for additional details.


Patches
-------
This build includes the following patches (in application order):

    scrollback-extended-fixed.diff      scrollback and reflow
    autoscroll-extended-0.9.3.diff      selection auto-scroll
    alpha-focus-0.9.3-fixed.diff        background transparency
    blinking-cursor-fixed.diff          blinking cursor
    selectioncolors.diff                selection colors
    fontdarken-0.9.3.diff               font darkening

